    "Attack Attribute": "None",
    "Defense Attributes": "Fire 20, Water 20, Wind 20, Earth 20, Holy 20, Unholy 20",
    "Skills": "Raid Boss Lv. 1 Raid Boss reward chance is reduced based on the level difference. Boss is higher: +5 - 85%, +6 - 70%, +7 - 50%, +8 - 35%. Player is higher: +6 - 85%, +7 - 70%, +8 - 50%. If player is 9 or more levels higher, Raid Curse is applied. Raid Boss Lv. 1 A messenger of Fafurion. This drake, Loch Ness, whose ancestor is the Water Dragon Fafurion, delivers messages from Fafurion to Lizardmen and Crokians. Since Fafurion is barely interested in these two insignificant tribes, Loch Ness handles them at its discretion. It despises creatures weaker than it is. Dragons Lv. 10 Takes 15% increased damage from attacks that are effective against Dragons. P. Def. +5% Max HP +5% Attack Range +30 Resistance to Hold +15% Resistance to Bow +10% Resistance to Crossbow +10% M. Def. -5% Resistance to Sword -10% Resistance to Dual Sword -10% HP Increase (1x) Lv. 1 MP Increase (1x) Lv. 1 Average P. Atk. Lv. 11 Average M. Atk. Lv. 11 Average P. Def. Lv. 11 Average M. Def. Lv. 11 Standard Type Lv. 2 Normal P. Def. and Evasion. One-handed Sword Lv. 3 One-handed Sword Resist Full Magic Attack Lv. 1",
